cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ndnperf in your research, please cite the original study as below."
type: software
title: "ndnperf: server-side performance evaluation tool for Named Data Networking (port to ndn-cxx 0.9)"
abstract: "ndnperf by Xavier Marchal measures the throughput, latency and processing time of an NDN server, in the way iPerf does for IP. This fork ports its C++ version to ndn-cxx 0.9 and integrates it into MiniNDN-WiFi."
authors:
